say | | [Hero] This armor... It looks ancient.
say | | [Hero] There are symbols on it that I don't understand.
say | | [Hero] It stands here, at the edge of the canyon, before the exit
say | | [Hero] But something tells me it's important.
say | | [Hero] Maybe it belonged to my ancestors?
say | | [Hero] Time to take it. It has to be with me.
say | | [Hero] Time to set out.
exit|
